WEBVTT

00:02.920 --> 00:06.760
Your Majesty this servant recently heard some rumors in the streets.

00:06.840 --> 00:09.173
Thought I must report to Your Majesty.

00:10.040 --> 00:15.827
Saying people in the streets say there's a fortune teller in Qingzhou who once met General Zhu.

00:16.320 --> 00:17.720
Said.

00:20.720 --> 00:25.600
What did he say? Said he observed the stars at night the Purple Star is dim the Emperor Star is unclear.

00:25.680 --> 00:31.320
There's a sign of the Breaking Army rising in the east and also said on General Zhu's face.

00:31.840 --> 00:33.240
There is royal aura.

